  "description": "\n\n2 x A3 RATED STUDIO APARTMENTS AVAILABLE IMMEDIATELY:\n\nINCLUDED IN MONTHLY RENT : SECURE PRIVATE WIFI NETWORK, AIR TO WATER HEATING, HOT WATER & REFUSE COLLECTION.\n\nThese A3 rated properties have  emerged from an extensive refurbishment project and are returned to the rental market completely transformed with a sophisticated contemporary feel throughout. Interiors are bright and spacious and include attractive benefits such as quality kitchens and shower rooms, excellent appliances and contemporary furniture. Located within a heartbeat of the city centre & situated conveniently in the popular Grove Park, the location of this property is superb being within close proximity to Rathmines Village, Portobello and the city centre. An endless variety of amenities both social and essential. The area is serviced by numerous bus routes and the Charlemont LUAS station.\n\nViewing highly recommended.",
